      <ul><li><a href="https://www.indiatoday.in/india/story/allahabad-high-court-directs-up-dgp-to-warn-police-over-misbehaviour-with-government-advocates-ptag-3016747-2026-10-13?utm_source=rss" rel="noopener">India Today</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
