      <ul><li><a href="https://www.business-standard.com/companies/news/co-working-overtakes-it-ites-as-india-s-top-office-occupier-anarock-report-126101301192_1.html" rel="noopener">Business Standard</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
