      <ul><li><a href="https://www.news18.com/india/cec-cjp-delhi-protest-live-updates-abhijeet-dipke-jantar-mantar-india-bloc-rahul-gandhi-gyanesh-kumar-resignation-liveblog-10379475.html" rel="noopener">News18 India</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
