      <ul><li><a href="https://www.business-standard.com/markets/news/ircon-international-stock-zooms-6-on-862-crore-order-win-from-railways-126101300341_1.html" rel="noopener">BS Personal Finance</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
