      <ul><li><a href="https://www.livemint.com/money/personal-finance/ppf-account-declared-irregular-after-12-years-what-happens-to-your-interest-high-court-ruling-explained-11791910200005.html" rel="noopener">Livemint Money</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
