    </div>
  </div>
  <nav class="catrow"><span class="catgrp"><b>News</b><a href="/category/national">national</a><a href="/category/world">world</a><a href="/category/defence">defence</a></span><span class="catgrp"><b>Money</b><a href="/category/business">business</a><a href="/category/finance">finance</a><a href="/category/education">education</a></span><span class="catgrp"><b>Sports</b><a href="/category/sports">sports</a><a href="/category/cricket">cricket</a></span><span class="catgrp"><b>Culture</b><a href="/category/entertainment">entertainment</a><a href="/category/positive">positive</a><a href="/category/funny">funny</a></span><span class="catgrp"><b>Life</b><a href="/category/science">science</a><a href="/category/environment">environment</a><a href="/category/space">space</a><a href="/category/health">health</a></span><span class="catgrp"><b>Tech</b><a href="/category/tech">tech</a><a href="/category/ai">ai</a></span></nav></div><div class="gtr"><span>Read in your language:</span><div id="google_translate_element"></div></div><div class="wrap"><main id="content"><p class="crumb"><a href="/">← Front page</a> · <a href="/archive">Archive</a> · <a href="/category/sports">sports</a></p>
     <article class="story single" data-beat="sports">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">SPORTS</span> · BBC Sport · 2026-10-13 · editor 10/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>Lawrence Dallaglio Auction Raises £100,500 Following Bankruptcy</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#sports</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>Former England rugby captain Lawrence Dallaglio has sold his 2003 World Cup winner's medal for £54,000 at auction. The sale included a British and Irish Lions cap for £11,000, an England cap for £8,000, and a 2003 Six Nations medal for £7,500. Other items, including four Premiership title medals, remained unsold.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-13/lawrence-dallaglio-auction-raises-100500-following-bankruptc.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Dallaglio, 54, auctioned the memorabilia after being declared bankrupt following a divorce. While the collection had an estimated value of £180,000, the event ultimately raised £100,500. Dallaglio recently stated on a podcast that financial difficulties and personal struggles led to his bankruptcy, noting he has since sought therapy.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: Concise and accurate summary that includes all key figures and context provided by the source.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/sport/rugby-union/articles/cxly4q1g796zo?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" rel="noopener">BBC Sport</a></li></ul>
