       <h1>Skoop Media Debuts Dutch Noir Crime Label at Mipcom</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#entertainment</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>International distributor Skoop Media has officially launched Dutch Noir, a new label dedicated to premium Dutch crime content. Debuting at Mipcom, the brand focuses on diverse genres including psychological thrillers, urban crime, organized-crime dramas, and heist series.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-13/skoop-media-debuts-dutch-noir-crime-label-at-mipcom.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>The initiative launches with an initial slate of 17 titles sourced from six different producers. The collection features four new Videoland Original series as part of its inaugural lineup, aiming to showcase the scale and attitude of Dutch crime storytelling to an international audience.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: Efficiently summarizes the launch of the new label and its inaugural slate using the provided source material.</p>
